+
+### Proof-local inventory
+
+`verification.k` contributes exactly:
+
+- four `[macro]` syntax declarations:
+  `FILTER-LOOP-BODY`, `FILTER-FUNCTION-BODY`, `FILTER-CLOSURE`, and
+  `FILTER-PROGRAM`; and
